{
  "id": "voa_lle_let_s_learn_english_level_2_lesson_4_run_away_with_t",
  "title": "Let’s Learn English - Level 2 - Lesson 4: Run Away With the Circus!",
  "titleKo": "VOA 중급 회화",
  "source": "VOA Learning English (미국 정부 제작물 - 퍼블릭 도메인). 원문: https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/let-s-learn-english---level-2---lesson-4-run-away-with-the-circus-/5782503.html",
  "audioType": "video",
  "audioUrl": "https://voa-video-ns.akamaized.net/pangeavideo/2021/02/8/8e/8e6a25fe-1336-4f85-901d-95d0dcabc112_480p.mp4",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://gdb.voanews.com/8e6a25fe-1336-4f85-901d-95d0dcabc112_tv_w1080_h608.jpg",
  "language": "en",
  "translationLanguage": "ko",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hello, I'm Anna.",
      "startMs": 9140,
      "endMs": 10780
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Pete.",
      "startMs": 11180,
      "endMs": 11820
    },
    {
      "text": "And welcome to He Said, She Said.",
      "startMs": 12180,
      "endMs": 14820
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there are always two sides.",
      "startMs": 15140,
      "endMs": 17900
    },
    {
      "text": "To every story, today's show is about circus arts.",
      "startMs": 18320,
      "endMs": 23160
    },
    {
      "text": "Circus?",
      "startMs": 24060,
      "endMs": 24600
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not an art form.",
      "startMs": 25880,
      "endMs": 26940
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes it is.",
      "startMs": 27740,
      "endMs": 28980
    },
    {
      "text": "No, it isn't.",
      "startMs": 29940,
      "endMs": 31160
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes it is.",
      "startMs": 31980,
      "endMs": 33440
    },
    {
      "text": "No it isn't.",
      "startMs": 34490,
      "endMs": 35390
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes it is.",
      "startMs": 35630,
      "endMs": 36310
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no it isn't.",
      "startMs": 36530,
      "endMs": 37610
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes it is.",
      "startMs": 37790,
      "endMs": 38970
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh dear, Anna and Pete do not agree about circus arts.",
      "startMs": 44690,
      "endMs": 50390
    },
    {
      "text": "But that's okay.",
      "startMs": 50610,
      "endMs": 51550
    },
    {
      "text": "We all have different opinions.",
      "startMs": 51950,
      "endMs": 53650
    },
    {
      "text": "Today's lesson is about agreeing and disagreeing.",
      "startMs": 54010,
      "endMs": 58270
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen to how Anna and Pete disagree or agree.",
      "startMs": 58350,
      "endMs": 62710
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's hope these two can agree on something.",
      "startMs": 62970,
      "endMs": 65790
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, let's run away with the circus.",
      "startMs": 66440,
      "endMs": 69580
    },
    {
      "text": "Recently, I went to a circus festival.",
      "startMs": 69580,
      "endMs": 73940
    },
    {
      "text": "There was a huge circus tent and many different circus performers.",
      "startMs": 74520,
      "endMs": 79240
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a celebration of circus arts.",
      "startMs": 79760,
      "endMs": 83060
    },
    {
      "text": "That looks fun, Anna, but I don't think circus performers are artists.",
      "startMs": 83680,
      "endMs": 88080
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they're athletes with interesting skills and costumes.",
      "startMs": 88520,
      "endMs": 93200
    },
    {
      "text": "That is a very interesting point of view, Pete, and I completely disagree.",
      "startMs": 93200,
      "endMs": 99220
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna, Michelangelo was an artist.",
      "startMs": 101100,
      "endMs": 103320
    },
    {
      "text": "Rembrandt was an artist.",
      "startMs": 104140,
      "endMs": 105960
    },
    {
      "text": "People who swing from ropes are not artists.",
      "startMs": 106630,
      "endMs": 109730
    },
    {
      "text": "I know it's not easy to swing from a bar and catch someone by the hand.",
      "startMs": 110270,
      "endMs": 114490
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to be very athletic to do that.",
      "startMs": 114650,
      "endMs": 117510
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a good point, Pete.",
      "startMs": 117670,
      "endMs": 118810
    },
    {
      "text": "They are athletic.",
      "startMs": 119450,
      "endMs": 120830
    },
    {
      "text": "But they are called trapeze artists.",
      "startMs": 120830,
      "endMs": 124810
    },
    {
      "text": "Trapeze artists.",
      "startMs": 125910,
      "endMs": 127310
    },
    {
      "text": "I hear what you're saying, Anna.",
      "startMs": 128000,
      "endMs": 129700
    },
    {
      "text": "I do.",
      "startMs": 129940,
      "endMs": 130240
    },
    {
      "text": "But where is the art?",
      "startMs": 130560,
      "endMs": 132920
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at these guys.",
      "startMs": 133520,
      "endMs": 134300
    },
    {
      "text": "They're jugglers.",
      "startMs": 135000,
      "endMs": 136080
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, they are skilled in the art of juggling.",
      "startMs": 136740,
      "endMs": 140560
    },
    {
      "text": "They have a special skill, but are they artists?",
      "startMs": 141020,
      "endMs": 143780
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "startMs": 144300,
      "endMs": 144600
    },
    {
      "text": "They're just throwing things back and forth.",
      "startMs": 145420,
      "endMs": 147660
    },
    {
      "text": "Kind of like you and me, Pete, we're going back and forth on this issue.",
      "startMs": 147660,
      "endMs": 151740
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't think we'll ever agree on this one.",
      "startMs": 152240,
      "endMs": 155910
    },
    {
      "text": "No, but we can agree that these young people are amazing.",
      "startMs": 156410,
      "endMs": 161070
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, yeah, we can agree on that.",
      "startMs": 161670,
      "endMs": 164890
    },
    {
      "text": "But still, they are very athletic, flipping and throwing each other around.",
      "startMs": 165330,
      "endMs": 170410
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I agree with you on that point.",
      "startMs": 170830,
      "endMs": 173190
    },
    {
      "text": "They did it.",
      "startMs": 173590,
      "endMs": 174590
    },
    {
      "text": "They agree.",
      "startMs": 174730,
      "endMs": 175370
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna says she agrees that the performers are athletic.",
      "startMs": 175370,
      "endMs": 179750
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a good point, Pete.",
      "startMs": 180190,
      "endMs": 181430
    },
    {
      "text": "They are athletic.",
      "startMs": 182130,
      "endMs": 183410
    },
    {
      "text": "I agree with you on that point.",
      "startMs": 183970,
      "endMs": 185610
    },
    {
      "text": "Now look for other ways they agree.",
      "startMs": 186270,
      "endMs": 188590
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna.",
      "startMs": 189850,
      "endMs": 190390
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna.",
      "startMs": 191610,
      "endMs": 192330
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry, sorry.",
      "startMs": 193950,
      "endMs": 195070
    },
    {
      "text": "But he's an artist too.",
      "startMs": 195410,
      "endMs": 196870
    },
    {
      "text": "He's telling a story with his sticks and his costume.",
      "startMs": 197270,
      "endMs": 201090
    },
    {
      "text": "What story?",
      "startMs": 201690,
      "endMs": 202550
    },
    {
      "text": "And what costume?",
      "startMs": 203440,
      "endMs": 204480
    },
    {
      "text": "I see your point, Pete.",
      "startMs": 204480,
      "endMs": 206850
    },
    {
      "text": "I really do.",
      "startMs": 207250,
      "endMs": 208290
    },
    {
      "text": "But circus performers do more than physical tricks.",
      "startMs": 208990,
      "endMs": 212110
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, look at these amazing performers.",
      "startMs": 212770,
      "endMs": 215190
    },
    {
      "text": "I will admit, I like their costumes.",
      "startMs": 216940,
      "endMs": 219800
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, Pete, let's let the performers speak for themselves.",
      "startMs": 220400,
      "endMs": 224780
    },
    {
      "text": "Kate and Piper tell stories while hanging upside down on a ring.",
      "startMs": 225360,
      "endMs": 230980
    },
    {
      "text": "Was it hard to interview them upside down?",
      "startMs": 231400,
      "endMs": 234340
    },
    {
      "text": "I interviewed them right side up, Pete.",
      "startMs": 234340,
      "endMs": 237060
    },
    {
      "text": "Kate says circus performing may be athletic, but it's not competitive.",
      "startMs": 237940,
      "endMs": 243480
    },
    {
      "text": "With most sports, you compete.",
      "startMs": 244020,
      "endMs": 246480
    },
    {
      "text": "It's an art form because, like, other sports are competing.",
      "startMs": 246820,
      "endMs": 249360
    },
    {
      "text": "This is simply performing and having fun.",
      "startMs": 249740,
      "endMs": 251660
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, Kate made a really good point.",
      "startMs": 252060,
      "endMs": 255740
    },
    {
      "text": "In athletics, there's a lot of competition.",
      "startMs": 256940,
      "endMs": 259840
    },
    {
      "text": "But still.",
      "startMs": 260790,
      "endMs": 261390
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's Piper, Pete.",
      "startMs": 261830,
      "endMs": 262910
    },
    {
      "text": "Please pay attention, Pete.",
      "startMs": 262910,
      "endMs": 264750
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, when you're up in the air doing circus, you have to perform.",
      "startMs": 265740,
      "endMs": 270560
    },
    {
      "text": "And so we learn to embody characters and to move fluidly and gracefully in artistic ways.",
      "startMs": 271400,
      "endMs": 276920
    },
    {
      "text": "And that is why they are artists.",
      "startMs": 277640,
      "endMs": 281820
    },
    {
      "text": "You're right, Anna.",
      "startMs": 283640,
      "endMs": 284560
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, you're right.",
      "startMs": 285760,
      "endMs": 287360
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just so beautiful.",
      "startMs": 288240,
      "endMs": 289880
    },
    {
      "text": "I know.",
      "startMs": 291610,
      "endMs": 292110
    },
    {
      "text": "I know, Pete.",
      "startMs": 293560,
      "endMs": 294260
    },
    {
      "text": "Good job, you two.",
      "startMs": 294260,
      "endMs": 297470
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm so glad that Anna and Pete finally agreed.",
      "startMs": 297970,
      "endMs": 301850
    },
    {
      "text": "Pete said, you're right, Anna.",
      "startMs": 302310,
      "endMs": 303950
    },
    {
      "text": "I agree, too.",
      "startMs": 304510,
      "endMs": 305830
    },
    {
      "text": "Circus arts are beautiful.",
      "startMs": 306190,
      "endMs": 307750
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember the website.",
      "startMs": 308130,
      "endMs": 309410
    }
  ]
}